#c140[i4] When opts.baseline is true, scoreDocument also scores a baseline by calling scoreContext with a null context and onProgress disabled.
  > src/score.ts::scoreDocument #a8ee4b9d71ce
#c141[i4] The informative metric is calculated only if a baseline exists; it averages points of probes that were unknown (0 points) in the baseline but have context scores.
