#c144[i3] The selfJudged flag in DocumentScore is true when the answering model's id appears among the judges returned by judgesOf(opts).
  > src/score.ts::scoreDocument #a8ee4b9d71ce
#c145[i5] The module exports a Message interface with string properties role and text.
  > src/snapshot.ts::Message #a6dcabac3cf6
#c146[i5] The private function textOf returns a string by extracting text from strings, arrays of strings or objects with a text field, and objects with a parts array; otherwise it returns an empty string.
  > src/snapshot.ts::textOf #c211aa2339c2
#c147[i5] parseConversation accepts JSON in three common shapes: an array of messages, an object with a messages or chat_messages array, or an object with a mapping of messages (OpenAI/Anthropic style).
