#c149[i4] parseConversation filters out messages whose role is "system" and excludes empty text after trimming; only messages with non‑empty text and non‑system role are added to the output array.
  > src/snapshot.ts::parseConversation #44e353c78333
#c150[i4] If no messages remain after processing, parseConversation throws an Error with message "conversation contains no messages".
