#c153[i5] collectSources returns a sorted list of text files under the given paths, respecting .gitignore (when in a git repo) and .hcsignore, and excludes files larger than maxBytes (default 256 KB) or non‑text files.
  > src/sources.ts::collectSources #c0440aacf4c2
#c154[i3] loadIgnores merges DEFAULT_IGNORES with extra patterns and any non‑comment, non‑blank lines from a .hcsignore file, then converts each pattern to a RegExp.
  > src/sources.ts::loadIgnores #e51bd33b0c75
#c155[i3] gitFiles runs "git ls-files -co --exclude-standard -z" in the repository root and returns an array of file paths, or null if the command fails.
